    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Oscar Rana, Spanish illustrator and animator, based Galicia (Pontevedra; studied at Universidad de Vigo). Experimental, geometric, comics-influenced work spanning illustration and animation, tagged Illustration plus 3D & motion. Co-founded RAPAPAWN (2017) with artist Cynthia Alfonso; clients include WeTransfer, NYT, MOOG, Bandcamp, Givenchy; featured by AIGA Eye on Design, It's Nice That, Creative Review; ASME Award 2023 (digital illustration, The Marshall Project). Mid-level to established independent artist/illustrator running his own small studio; seniority read as mid-senior, ~8+ yrs practice; autonomy 4 (runs his own studio, takes commissions independently). Work Status Studio: operates through RAPAPAWN (rapapawn.com), not as a freelancer-for-hire or employee; confirmed via rapapawn.com and tumblr CV (rapapawnnn.tumblr.com/cv). IG handle @oscaranha confirmed: matches name, links to RAPAPAWN, collaboration with Cynthia Alfonso. Email: rapapawn@gmail.com (public contact on their tumblr CV). LinkedIn: no profile found after two searches and checking their own CV; not listed.",
